===
**babe, baby.** In the primary sense *baby* is now the regular form, & *babe* archaic, poetic, or rhetorical. In figurative use, *babe* implies guilelessness, innocence, or ignorance, & *baby* unmanliness.

**baboo.** Pronounce bah'bōō. Pl. -oos; see ^^-O(E)S^^ 4.
