**bacchanal, bacchant(e).** *Bacchanal* & *bacchant* are both used of males or females, or males & females, but with a tendency to be restricted to males; *bacchante* is used of females only. *Bacchant* is always pronounced bă'kant; *bacchante* bakă'nt,
